    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d382">

                <pb facs="1756" n="1605" sameAs="frus:frus1961-63v07-09mSupp/pg1605"/>

                <head>382. Letter from Humphrey to Rusk, June 12<anchor n="1" xml:id="d382-f1"
                    /></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline>
                        <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-head" calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1961-06-12">June 12, 1961</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d382-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d382-1"/>
                <opener>
                    <salute>Dear Mr. Secretary:</salute>
                </opener>
                <p>Take 10 minutes and read the attached. Garst is right and somebody ought to do
                    something about it.</p>
                <p>Sincerely,</p>
                <closer><signed>Hubert H.
                    Humphrey</signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d382-a1.xml" xpointer="d382-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
